        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw arambarira, ati Mwana w’umuntu, ayo magufa ni wo muryango wose wa Isirayeli: ehe baravuga, bat’ Amagufa yacu arūmye, n’ivyizigiro vyacu birabuze, turashize rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
