              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abantu b’ubgoko bganyu ni bakubaza, bati Mbega ntiwodusobanurira ivyo uko bigenze? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uz’ ubabgire, ut’ Uku ni k’ Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Rāba ngira nābīre inkoni ya Yosefu, iri mu kuboko kwa Efurayimu, n’ imiryango y’Abisirayeli bīherereje kuri we; maze mbungikanye n’ inkoni ya Yuda, mbagire inkoni imwe, ngo babe umwe mu kuboko kwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ inkoni wanditseko zize zibe mu kuboko kwawe mu maso yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
